Upstream-Name: OnionPress
Upstream-Contact: Brewster Kahle <brewster@archive.org>
Source: https://github.com/brewsterkahle/onionpress
Comment:
 The package holds OnionPress's own launcher, tray, Python package,
 WordPress plugins and theme, and container build contexts. It bundles
 nothing from another project: Tor, WordPress and MariaDB run from
 container images that Docker pulls at first start, and every other
 dependency is a Debian package named in the control file's Depends.

